# MSI — GPU Ollama + OmniRoute + Buzz

Runbook: `docs/LLM_MESH_BRIDGE.md` · `docs/BUZZ_MSI_AGENTS.md`

## MSI worker

- [ ] WSL2 or Bazzite; Tailscale `msi-gpu`
- [ ] Ollama with GPU: `ollama pull` model sized to VRAM
- [ ] OmniRoute local OR use tailnet `OMNIROUTE_URL` on MacBook (pick one)
- [ ] `./scripts/llm-mesh-preflight.sh` on MSI
- [ ] `./scripts/msi-buzz-preflight.sh` when Buzz installed

## Herdr

- [ ] `herdr` on MSI (socket on MSI, not Mac)
- [ ] Obsidian on Mac can SSH-forward socket — `OBSIDIAN_HERDR_BRIDGE.md`
- [ ] Vault `herdr/msi.md` = this checklist

## Hermes / Paperclip

- [ ] `hermes-gateway` + `tailscale serve 8642`
- [ ] Paperclip external agent invite; manager Hermes Lead